rsion of  hitman for you  what i hope is that this video has  encouraged you to break out of your  comfort zone and give some of these a  try  it might just make an already fantastic  game even better  i had a lot of fun making this video as  the hitman world of assassination  trilogy is one of my  favorite games period if you end up  giving  any of this a try let me know your  experience in the comments  one of my favorite parts about hitman is  the stories people share of their  spectacular successes or failed attempts  and i'd love to hear some catch you all  next time  [Music]  you

